SUMMARY:2026 Gala Kickoff Party
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Art Museum is thrilled to invite you to our 2026 Gala\, a weekend filled with art\, inspiration\, and community\, all in support of the arts. With two exciting events\, you’ll experience creativity and elegance while contributing to our mission. \nGala Kickoff Party\nFriday\, June 5 | 7–10pm\nKick off the weekend in style at our Gala Kickoff Party \nAuction Preview: Get an exclusive first look at the incredible items and experiences up for bid at the Gala. \nInteractive Bites: Savor locally sourced\, artistically inspired light bites\, served on palettes with vibrant colors and creative flair. \nSignature Cocktails: Sip on drinks specially crafted for the event. \nBuy Tickets
